"{{Term/Store|By Firefly's Light||Series, BotW}}" is a [[Side Quest]] in {{BotW}}.<ref>{{Cite|{{Big|By Firefly's Light}}<br/>{{Color BotW|Side Quest|Kakariko Village}}|Adventure Log|BotW}}</ref>

==Overview==
After [[Link]] has completed both "[[Find the Fairy Fountain]]" and "[[Flown the Coop]]", he can speak to [[Lasli]] in [[Kakariko Village]], who complains she has to head home straight away instead of searching for [[Sunset Firefly|Sunset Fireflies]].<ref>{{Cite|*sigh* They say the roads are dangerous at night, so I have to come straight home without searching for {{Color BotW|Red|fireflies}}...|Lasli|BotW}}</ref> She misses them and has become sick of going without them.<ref>{{Cite|I miss them so much. And the night sky... Now it's the same tired thing every night. I'm so sick of it...|Lasli|BotW}}</ref> Lasli wishes that the Sunset Fireflies could come to her so she could see them,<ref>{{Cite|If only the {{Color BotW|Red|fireflies}} would come to play here so I could still see them...|Lasli|BotW}}</ref> which begins the [[Side Quest]].

To satisfy Lasli, Link must gather five Sunset Fireflies. They can be found around the bridge nearby, though they can be obtained from anywhere. When Link speaks to Lasli with Fireflies in his [[Inventory]], she notices their glowing and demands to see them.<ref>{{Cite|Huh? That glowing... Could it be you caught some?! Show me, show me!|Lasli|BotW}}</ref>

Once Link releases five Sunset Fireflies in her home, Lasli will stand and express her happiness.<ref>{{Cite|{{Big|...Oh! Wow!}}<br/><br/>Look at all those {{Color BotW|Red|fireflies}}!|Lasli|BotW}}</ref> To express her gratitude, she gives Link a [[Purple Rupee]].<ref>{{Cite|Thank you... This is all I have to offer, but please accept it with my gratitude!|Lasli|BotW}}</ref> She then comments on how pretty their glow is, describing it as magical.<ref>{{Cite|They glow so prettily... It's magical...|Lasli|BotW}}</ref> If Link says that Lasli is also pretty, she will thank him.<ref>{{Cite|[You're pretty too.] Heehee! Thanks!|Lasli|BotW}}</ref> However, if Link reminds her of their short lifespan, she becomes frustrated and remarks that boys are unromantic.<ref>{{Cite|[They don't live long.] Ugh! Boys are SO unromantic...|Lasli|BotW}}</ref> Afterwards, the Side Quest will be completed.

